 "preloader_behaviour_from_disassembly": {
  "entry_and_export_1": "DllMain (RVA 0xB030) and export ordinal 1 (RVA 0xB010) are 'ud2' stubs in section .entry; their unwind info names handler RVA 0x2040, which sets ContextRecord.Rip = ImageBase + handler-data RVA and returns ExceptionContinueExecution. Real targets: DllMain -> 0x2000, ordinal 1 -> 0x37E0.",
  "dllmain_0x2000": "calls init 0x2390, then tail-jumps to the runtime.dll entry pointer stored at preloader RVA 0xA078 with r9 = context block at RVA 0xA048",
  "init_0x2390": [
   "resolves ntdll!wine_get_version via LdrGetProcedureAddress; result decides the load path",
   "OS checks (both paths reach them; exact branch order not traced): version resource VS_FIXEDFILEINFO, RtlWow64GetProcessMachines (x64 vs ARM64), build >= 17763 ('Windows 10 1809 or newer'). Windows path (no wine_get_version): NtCreateSection(SEC_IMAGE, PAGE_EXECUTE) on runtime.dll + NtMapViewOfSection near the module",
   "Wine path: NtOpenFile(<preloader dir>\\runtime.dll), NtReadFile headers (MZ/PE/PE32+ checks), NtAllocateVirtualMemory reserve within +/-2 GB of the preloader at 2 MB alignment, then per section: commit RW, NtReadFile raw data, NtProtectVirtualMemory from a characteristics table (RVA 0x6798); finally applies base relocations (0x2170). This matches the live MEM_PRIVATE image at 0x700000000000",
   "fills a context table (RVA 0xA0D0-0xA158) with MessageBoxW, RegGetValueW, RtlQueryEnvironmentVariable_U, RtlExpandEnvironmentStrings, RtlDosPathNameToNtPathName_U_WithStatus, RtlCreateProcessParametersEx, RtlCreateEnvironment, ZwQuerySystemInformation, ZwCreateUserProcess, ZwSetInformationFile, ZwCreateFile, ZwCreateThreadEx, ZwQueryInformationFile, ZwQueryInformationProcess, ZwClose, ZwQueryDirectoryFile, ZwWaitForSingleObject, ZwDeleteFile, then calls the runtime entry with code 0x25665CD7",
   "reads environment variable PACKER_CRASH_AT (RtlQueryEnvironmentVariable, parsed as a number)"
  ],
  "error_strings": "OS-version refusals, 'Wine, Proton, and Steam Deck are not supported', 'Syscall emulation is disabled in this Wine build', 'File version mismatch between the preloader and runtime DLLs', 'Conflicting software detected!', 'The program encountered %08lX at %08lX during initialization.'"
 },
