  "imports": "only 4 placeholder imports (ntdll RtlPcToFileHeader, KERNEL32 CloseHandle, USER32 CloseWindow, GDI32 CloseEnhMetaFile); no exports",
  "code": "packer30 (2.3 MB) and packer31 (47 MB) are plaintext x86-64 on disk (entropy 5-6.5) with a valid 28,601-entry exception table; sampled code is mixed boolean-arithmetic obfuscation (not/and/imul with 64-bit constants). Entry RVA 0x560040 is a jmp into packer30 followed by non-code bytes. packer1 code section has 102 of 377 pages at entropy >= 7.9",
  "data": "packer0 (4.6 MB read-only) is mostly high entropy (798/1151 pages >= 7.9); its few plaintext strings are mbedTLS-style X.509 printing strings, MSVC STL errors, and UTF-16 crash-dumper strings (THEIA_%llu_%llu.dmp, full-dump prompt when Shift is held, upload with HTTP code, Arrowhead Zendesk support text, register dump lines)",
